{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01C2GxyZQcFTj5enCAA3d197","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task carefully:\n\n1. I need to create three files for pkg/sys/ that provide platform-independent file metadata abstraction\n2. The files are:\n   - `pkg/sys/stat.go` - Platform-independent FileMetadata struct and Stat/Lstat functions\n   - `pkg/sys/stat_darwin.go` - Darwin-specific extractMetadata\n   - `pkg/sys/stat_linux.go` - Linux-specific extractMetadata\n\nLet me first read the required reading files that aren't already provided in the context.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22522,"cache_read_input_tokens":16066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22522},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50620cf1-5bb3-4157-af04-e568f6bf482d","uuid":"ca37222b-432f-482a-981b-f62152e70364"}
